  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operational Research Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall impact of the project is to improve the health outcomes of poor people in the low income countries where the project is implemented. The long term outcomes are improved health programme performance and health service delivery. The medium term outcomes are increased use of research in health policy and practice, increased incorporation of operational research (OR) conducted by national personnel in programmes and a sustained capacity to mentor and retain skilled OR personnel. The short term outcomes are the increased amount of independently conducted, policy relevant operational research, the implementation of the findings of this research and improved routine monitoring and evaluation in health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
